Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21
Quest 83 "Subdual of Gavolt"
    Journal "[Sentinel] Patrick asked me to subdue five Gavolts for him."
    Kill 5 of 350 at direction_12

Requires player level >= 11

Rewards
    Give 6250 experience
    Choose one
        Give 1 of 202003005
        Give 1 of 242003005
        Give 1 of 262003005
        Give 1 of 282003005

direction_12 = location "Gavolt" about "Gavolt\nBird monsters endowed with power by Pathos`s evil energy" found "Inhabits Seashore of Hope" at 566 260 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, wonder what's going on with the food rationing. [Sentinel] Patrick should know about it. Go ask him."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Moradon is in my hands. What do you want?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Wheat bread, Moradon's special local product, has killer taste. But since not too long ago, Gavolts raided the harvested mill and as a result, the food supply is running low and the number of citizens suffering from malnutrition rising. Can you wipe those monsters out and help the farmers of Moradon?"

On in_progress
    Say "In order for the farmers to be relieved, at least five of them may have to be caught."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_12

On ready
    Say "Master, you've done a decent job at wiping out Gavolts. Go back to [Sentinel] Patrick ."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Good work. The wheat supply has been normalized again. Let's indulge in plenty of bread and wine tonight."
